`simulate()` now follows the lme4 `re.form` convention.
• `re.form = NA` (the default) or `~0` draws fresh random effects.
• `re.form = NULL` holds the fitted random effects fixed.
ℹ Earlier drmTMB versions gave the explicit values the reverse meaning; check
  code written for them.
This message is displayed once per session.
